<title>USA: AmeriResource Q3 loss narrowed.</title>
<headline>AmeriResource Q3 loss narrowed.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriResource Technologies Inc reduced its third-quarter loss to $298,570 from a year-ago loss of $1.7 million, the company said.</p>
<p>The consulting, engineering and construction firm also said it closed additional unprofitable engineering offices during the quarter. It said it continues its efforts to become profitable and overcome its cash flow problems by downsizing unprofitable operations.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
